•	Transaction Scenario: Updating patient status during pharmacy visits requires transactional atomicity.
•	Implementation: Wrapped multi-table updates (Pharmacy Log and clinical metrics) within BEGIN TRANSACTION and COMMIT TRANSACTION blocks with explicit TRY...CATCH exception handling and 
automatic ROLLBACK on failure.
•	Concurrency: Configured REPEATABLE READ isolation levels to eliminate Non-Repeatable and Phantom Reads when multiple data clerks enter records concurrently during peak clinical hours.
